# Sediment bacterial communities associated with Macrocystis pyrifera forests
# Final statistical analyses and figures for the manuscript
# ----------------------------------------------------------
#
# This script starts from the final filtered phyloseq object (Sed_16S_filtered.rds project 2) used for the
