# used for the RDA are entered explicitly below because they were not included
# in the original Env.csv metadata file.
#
#
# Expected input:
#   data/Sed_16S_filtered.rds
#
# Expected sample_data columns:
#   Type, Site, Date
#
# Site levels:
#   Bahia_Buzo, San_Gregorio, Buque_Quemado
# Date levels:
#   August, March

# ---- Packages ---------------------------------------
